# logs
logs/
*.log

# editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Customer-facing runtime state — written into a user's project by the
# installer / $a2h-init. Should never appear in this repo; ignored defensively
# in case someone tests the installer from inside this checkout.
# NOTE: .agents/plugins/ and .codex-plugin/ ARE shipped (not ignored).
.migbot/
.codex/
.agents/skills/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Local reference notes
DATA_REPORTING_MAP.md

# Parity copy of coverage rules into Nuitka dist (issue #44)
**/_entry.dist/coverage-rules.json

# 测试 skill 的看板账号(本机私有,绝不提交)
tools/**/.env
